Z||000000||danny boy||07-21-2001||10:26 PM|||| Took the GT out today. First time in a few months. Its almost all black primer and not so hideous to drive now.I went to my mom's house to pick up my sister and on the way home got stopped at a two lane into one lane light. In the lane next to me was a late 80's Daytona auto. Girl didn't look over, so I didn't know we were racing, but when the light changed she gunned it. I mashed it and on the 1-2 shift just walked her .Put me in a good mood.When the 2-3 shift happened I let off and shot some flames at her. I wish I wouldn't have learned my car would do that, but hey, its cool.||||reg||7
